---
// Public custom software page. The BWJ side of the cross-brand pair: Build with
// Jeremy answers "who do I hire", Build My System answers "what do we build".
// Mirror of buildmysystem.co/consulting (same sections, pointing the other way).
// The client-only plan builder that used to live here is /your-plan/.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema, faqSchema, serviceSchema, SITE_URL } from '../../utils/schema';
import { crossBrandHref } from '../../utils/cross-brand';

const url = `${SITE_URL}/custom-software`;

const bmsHero = crossBrandHref('https://buildmysystem.co/pricing', 'custom-software-hero');
const bmsQuote = crossBrandHref('https://buildmysystem.co/pricing', 'custom-software-compare');
const bmsHome = crossBrandHref('https://buildmysystem.co', 'custom-software-cta');

const faqs = [
  {
    question: 'Do you build custom software?',
    answer:
      'Yes. Custom software is built under Build My System, my software company for service businesses. Same team, same standards, with its own site, a quote builder, and published pricing. Build with Jeremy is the consulting side.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is the difference between Build with Jeremy and Build My System?',
    answer:
      'Build with Jeremy is operations consulting: finding the constraint, fixing the process, and training the team. Build My System designs, builds, hosts, and maintains the software your business runs on. Some clients need one, many use both.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How much does custom software cost?',
    answer:
      'It depends on how much of the business the system has to run. Build My System publishes its pricing, and its quote builder gives you an itemized number in a few minutes. Payment plans are available.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Should I fix my process before building software?',
    answer:
      'Usually, yes. Software built around a broken workflow makes the same mess faster. If you are not sure what the system should do yet, start with a Systems Audit call and we will work that out first.',
  },
];

const jsonLd = [
  breadcrumbSchema([
    { name: 'Home', url: SITE_URL },
    { name: 'Custom Software', url },
  ]),
  serviceSchema({
    name: 'Custom Software for Service Businesses',
    description:
      'Custom business systems for service businesses, designed and built by Build My System, with operations consulting from Build with Jeremy when the process needs fixing first.',
    url,
  }),
  faqSchema(faqs),
];

const check = 'M5 13l4 4L19 7';
---

<Layout
  title="Custom Software for Service Businesses | Build with Jeremy"
  description="Need custom software, not consulting? Systems for service businesses are built under Build My System, my software company. Here is which one you need."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="theme-bg-primary">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="text-brand font-semibold mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Custom Software</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold theme-text-primary leading-tight">
          Sometimes the answer is a system, not more advice.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg theme-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Plenty of operational problems end with something that needs to be built. When that happens, I don't hand
          you to a dev shop. The software gets built under Build My System, my software company for service
          businesses: same team, same standards, published pricing.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href={bmsHero} data-track="cta_click" class="btn btn-accent text-lg px-8 py-4">Build your quote at Build My System</a>
          <a href="/contact/" data-track="cta_click" class="btn btn-outline text-lg px-8 py-4">Book a free Systems Audit call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE DIFFERENCE -->
  <section class="theme-bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold theme-text-primary">Software or consulting: which do you need?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Build My System -->
        <div class="card p-8 border-2 border-brand relative flex flex-col">
          <span class="absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-brand text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Custom software</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold theme-text-primary">Build My System</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="theme-text-secondary mb-6">The software your business runs on, built, hosted, and improved for you.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1">
            {[
              'You know what you need built',
              'The problem is the tools: too many apps, too much retyping',
              'You want one system that runs the work and the reporting',
              'You want it hosted, maintained, and improved over time',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 theme-text-secondary text-sm">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-dark flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d={check} /></svg>
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-6 border-t" style="border-color: var(--border-color);">
            <p class="text-sm theme-text-muted">Published pricing and an itemized quote in a few minutes. Payment plans available.</p>
            <a href={bmsQuote} data-track="cta_click" class="btn btn-accent w-full text-center mt-4">Build your quote &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Build with Jeremy -->
        <div class="card p-8 flex flex-col">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold theme-text-primary">Build with Jeremy</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="theme-text-secondary mb-6">Fractional COO, strategic consulting, and process improvement.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1">
            {[
              'You need help figuring out what to build',
              'The problem is process, ownership, or the team',
              'You want a fractional COO on retainer',
              'You want the system to stick after it ships',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 theme-text-secondary text-sm">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent-dark flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d={check} /></svg>
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-6 border-t" style="border-color: var(--border-color);">
            <p class="text-sm theme-text-muted">Starting at $1,250/mo (Strategic Ops Partner retainer)</p>
            <a href="/services/" data-track="cta_click" class="btn btn-primary w-full text-center mt-4">See consulting services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT JEREMY -->
  <section class="theme-bg-primary">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="card p-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start">
          <picture class="flex-shrink-0">
            <source type="image/avif" srcset="/images/jeremy-headshot-avatar-96.avif 96w, /images/jeremy-headshot-avatar-160.avif 160w" sizes="80px" />
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/jeremy-headshot-avatar-96.webp 96w, /images/jeremy-headshot-avatar-160.webp 160w" sizes="80px" />
            <img
              src="/images/jeremy-headshot-avatar-160.jpg"
              alt="Jeremy Pittman, founder of Build with Jeremy and Build My System"
              width="80"
              height="80"
              class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </picture>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold theme-text-primary text-xl">Jeremy Pittman</h3>
            <p class="text-brand text-sm font-medium mb-4">Founder, Build with Jeremy &amp; Build My System</p>
            <div class="space-y-3 theme-text-secondary text-sm">
              <p>
                12 years at Google in operations, programs, and product launches. Now I help service businesses fix how
                they run and build the systems that keep them running.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong class="theme-text-primary">Build with Jeremy</strong> is for businesses that need operations
                consulting. <strong class="theme-text-primary">Build My System</strong> is for businesses that need
                custom software. Plenty need both.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHEN YOU NEED BOTH -->
  <section class="theme-bg-secondary">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold theme-text-primary">Many clients use both.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg theme-text-secondary">
          The order depends on where the business is stuck.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        {[
          ['Consulting first', 'Fix the process, then build the system around it. No point automating a workflow that is about to change.'],
          ['Software first', 'Get the system running, use it for a few months, then bring in consulting to tighten how the team works with it.'],
          ['Both together', 'An operations retainer alongside a system that is being built and improved in parallel.'],
        ].map(([title, body], i) => (
          <div class="card p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <span class="text-brand font-bold">{i + 1}</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold theme-text-primary mb-2">{title}</h3>
            <p class="theme-text-secondary text-sm">{body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="theme-bg-primary">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold theme-text-primary text-center mb-10">Common questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {faqs.map((faq) => (
          <details data-track="faq_open" class="group theme-bg-secondary rounded-xl border transition-colors" style="border-color: var(--border-color);">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer p-6 font-semibold theme-text-primary">
              {faq.question}
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 theme-text-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 theme-text-secondary">{faq.answer}</div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand to-primary py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Not sure which you need?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80">
        Book a free Systems Audit call. We'll work out together whether you need software, consulting, or both.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" data-track="cta_click" class="btn btn-accent text-lg px-8 py-4">Book a free Systems Audit call</a>
        <a href={bmsHome} data-track="cta_click" class="btn text-lg px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-brand transition-colors">
          Visit Build My System &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/60 text-sm">30 minutes. I'll tell you honestly if we're a good fit.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
